@startuml deployment-infra-simple
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Deployment & Build Infrastructure

node "Developer Environment" {
    [ELMOS CLI] as App
    [QEMU Emulator] as Emulator
}

node "Toolchain Cache" {
    [GCC Compilers] as Toolchain
    [Kernel Sources] as Kernel
    [Board Definitions] as BSP
}

node "Build Artifacts" {
    [Compiled Binaries] as Artifacts
    [Root Filesystem] as Rootfs
    [Disk Images] as Images
}

App --> Toolchain : get tools
App --> Kernel : clone/patch
App --> BSP : read firmware
Toolchain --> Artifacts : compile
App --> Rootfs : create
Rootfs --> Images : assemble
Emulator -.-> Images : boot

@enduml
